e: <code>sync_baseline_versions.py</code> · <code>multi_release_ingest.py</code> · <code>multi_release_report.py</code></span>\n</p>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"br-grid\">\n<article><span>Requirements (Gesamt)</span><strong>5,013</strong><small>4,222 Adaptive / 791 Classic</small></article>\n<article><span>Gespeicherte Versionen</span><strong>6,272</strong><small>mit SHA-256 Inhalts-Hashes</small></article>\n<article><span>Abgedeckte Releases</span><strong>11</strong><small>R17-03, R17-10, R18-03, R18-10, R19-03, ...</small></article>\n<article><span>Multi-CPU-Pipeline</span><strong>10 Workers</strong><small>parallele Ingestion &amp; Delta-Analyse</small></article>\n</div>\n\n<details class=\"br-section\" open>\n<summary><strong>Extraktions-Details &amp; Plattform-Aufschlüsselung (Lauf 2026-09-30)</strong></summary>\n<div class=\"br-table-wrap\">\n<table class=\"br-table\">\n<thead><tr><th>Plattform</th><th>Requirements</th><th>Versionseinträge</th><th>Releases &amp; Umfang</th><th>Dokumente / Module</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>AUTOSAR Adaptive Platform (AP)</strong></td>\n<td>4,222</td>\n<td>4,278</td>\n<td>R25-11 Baseline + Multi-Release-Abgleich mit R20-11</td>\n<td><code>SWS_AIDSM</code>, <code>SWS_CORE</code>, <code>SWS_DM</code>, <code>SWS_EM</code>, <code>SWS_LOG</code>, <code>SWS_PER</code>, <code>SWS_PHM</code>, <code>SWS_SM</code>, <code>SWS_TS</code>, <code>SWS_UCM</code>, etc.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>AUTOSAR Classic Platform (CP)</strong></td>\n<td>791</td>\n<td>1,994</td>\n<td>11 Releases (R17-03, R17-10, R18-03, R18-10, R19-03, R19-11, R20-11, R21-11, R22-11, R25-11, R32-11)</td>\n<td><code>SWS_Com</code>, <code>SWS_LDCOM</code>, <code>SWS_Dlt</code>, <code>RS_MCR</code>, <code>SWS_CAN</code>, etc.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</details>\n\n<details class=\"br-section\" open>\n<summary><strong>Verwandte Berichte &amp; Revisions-Werkzeuge</strong></summary>\n<div class=\"br-table-wrap\" style=\"padding:1rem;\">\n<ul 